@title Building Permit Routing
@subtitle Whitcombe City planning office, current as of 2026-10-01

# Routing flow

diagram permit dir=TB title="Building permit routing"
permit: s "Application received" ext
permit: q1 "Submission complete?" decision
permit: ret "Return to applicant" ext
permit: q2 "Project value over 50000 dollars?" decision
permit: fast "Fast-track review" svc
permit: q3 "In a historic district?" decision
permit: hb "Heritage Board review" team
permit: plan "Plan review" team
permit: done "Permit issued" ext
permit: s -> q1
permit: q1 -> ret : no
permit: q1 -> q2 : yes
permit: q2 -> fast : no
permit: q2 -> q3 : yes
permit: q3 -> hb : yes
permit: q3 -> plan : no
permit: hb -> plan : cleared
permit: fast -> done : approved
permit: plan -> done : approved

# Review times

- Completeness check: within 2 business days.
- Fast-track review: within 3 business days.
- Plan review: within 15 business days.
- Heritage Board review: within 30 days, added on top of the plan review time.

# Fees

A base fee of 180 dollars applies to every application, plus 0.8 percent of the project value above 50000 dollars.

For example, a 150000 dollar project pays 180 dollars plus 0.8 percent of 100000 dollars, which is 800 dollars, so 980 dollars in total.
